        "text": "Another argument in favor of technical analysis in the crypto industry is its reliance on price data. Some argue that many crypto traders are not interested so much in the fundamentals of a project, but are mostly driven by price predictions. This makes technical analysis more suitable. Others have argued for crypto investors to focus more on the fundamentals. Of course, fundamental and technical analysis are useful in distinct ways. How should they be applied to crypto trading and investing? That's what we will explore in the next module.",
